flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B{All readings already sent}

    B -- Yes --> C([Return])

    B -- No --> D[Print reading and transmitting message]

    D --> E{One wire reset successful}

    E -- Yes --> F[Send Skip ROM command]
    F --> G[Start temperature conversion]

    E -- No --> H[Continue]

    G --> H

    H --> I[Delay conversion time]

    I --> J{OLED currently active}

    J -- Yes --> K[Clear OLED buffer]
    K --> L[Set OLED font]
    L --> M[Display sender information]
    M --> N[Display sensor count]
    N --> O[Display battery voltage]
    O --> P[Display LoRa RSSI]
    P --> Q[Display ROM sleep time]
    Q --> R[Display auxiliary sleep time]
    R --> S[Send OLED buffer]

    J -- No --> T[Skip OLED update]

    S --> T

    T --> U[Set probe index i to 0]

    U --> V{i less than device count}

    V -- Yes --> W[Read temperature from probe]
    W --> X[Create temperature packet]
    X --> Y[Convert ROM value to uppercase]
    Y --> Z[Transmit temperature packet]

    Z --> AA{Transmission successful}

    AA -- Yes --> AB[Print transmitted packet]
    AA -- No --> AC[Print transmission error]

    AB --> AD[Delay between packets]
    AC --> AD

    AD --> AE[Increment probe index]
    AE --> V

    V -- No --> AF{DS2413 water detector available}

    AF -- Yes --> AG[Read DS2413 PIO state]

    AG --> AH{DS2413 read successful}

    AH -- Yes --> AI[Update top water detection state]
    AI --> AJ[Update bottom water detection state]
    AJ --> AK[Print water detection status]

    AH -- No --> AL[Set water states to error]
    AL --> AM[Print DS2413 read failed]

    AK --> AN[Continue]
    AM --> AN

    AF -- No --> AO[Set water states to not available]
    AO --> AP[Print no DS2413 found]

    AN --> AQ[Delay between packets]
    AP --> AQ

    AQ --> AR[Create complete packet indicator]
    AR --> AS[Transmit complete packet]

    AS --> AT{Complete packet transmission successful}

    AT -- Yes --> AU[Print complete packet]
    AT -- No --> AV[Print complete packet error]

    AU --> AW[Delay between packets]
    AV --> AW

    AW --> AX[Set all readings sent true]

    AX --> AY[Print ready for sleep message]

    AY --> AZ([End])
